    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2150_head_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "5F8495A42219FBF1",
      "text": "I would like to extend my thanks to everyone who\\nmade this extraordinary tournament possible.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2150_head_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "5F8492A42219F6D8",
      "text": "Each and every Trainer demonstrated beautifully\\nthe bond they share with their Pokémon.\\r\\nI couldn’t take my eyes off any of the matches![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2150_head_teacher_03a",
      "hash64": "683FC9E5F221F59E",
      "text": "“Taking lessons from tradition—growing stronger\\nand greater.”[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2150_head_teacher_03b",
      "hash64": "683FC8E5F221F3EB",
      "text": "“Leading the way into the future—while valuing\\nour individuality.”[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2150_head_teacher_04a",
      "hash64": "6850C9E5F23068D1",
      "text": "That is our motto at Naranja Academy... And the\\ntournament truly lived up to our ideals![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2150_head_teacher_04b",
      "hash64": "6850C6E5F23063B8",
      "text": "That is our motto at Uva Academy... And the\\ntournament truly lived up to our ideals![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2150_head_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "5F8499A4221A02BD",
      "text": "Now, I’m aware my speeches tend to get a little,\\nshall we say, overlong, so I’ll wrap it up there.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2150_head_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "5F8496A42219FDA4",
      "text": "I now turn the floor over to our special guest,\\nChairwoman Geeta.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2150_top_01",
      "hash64": "0A41A185D833AAB5",
      "text": "The friendly rivalry of the Trainers... The cheering\\nand encouragement from the crowd...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2150_top_02",
      "hash64": "0A419E85D833A59C",
      "text": "I feel like these are the perfect ingredients for\\nthe academy—[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2150_top_03",
      "hash64": "0A419F85D833A74F",
      "text": "no, for the whole Paldea region to become more\\nlively and energized![VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2150_top_04",
      "hash64": "0A419C85D833A236",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Champion [VAR 0x0100(0000)] was far\\nstronger\\r\\ntoday\\r\\nthan\\r\\nwhen\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]she\\r\\ntook\\r\\nthe\\r\\nPokémon\\r\\nLeague’s\\r\\nfinal test...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
